# Member, roster, directory and ward lists (real member data); never commit. Every letter case is spelled out:
# git on Linux matches case-sensitively. Only data-file suffixes, so code such as Members.tsx is never ignored.
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Xx]
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Oo][Dd][Ss]
*[Mm][Ee][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr]*.[Nn][Uu][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr][Ss]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Xx]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Oo][Dd][Ss]
*[Rr][Oo][Ss][Tt][Ee][Rr]*.[Nn][Uu][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr][Ss]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Xx]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Oo][Dd][Ss]
*[Dd][Ii][Rr][Ee][Cc][Tt][Oo][Rr][Yy]*.[Nn][Uu][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr][Ss]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Cc][Ss][Vv]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Tt][Ss][Vv]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss][Xx]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Xx][Ll][Ss]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Oo][Dd][Ss]
*[Ww][Aa][Rr][Dd]*[Ll][Ii][Ss][Tt]*.[Nn][Uu][Mm][Bb][Ee][Rr][Ss]
